# the source table and the registered generators
#
# every source a generator reads is one row of the source table, with its
# upstream, its exact revision, its licence and its checksum, and its
# attribution in masc's NOTICE. every set's generator is one row of the
# generators. adding a set's generator is a row in each and its module.

